OL,5,G1400 Adolf Hitler's War
OL,6,     FVernichtungskrieg: Adolf Hitler
OL,7,     Fhas his mind on making Germany
OL,8,     Finto a great empire by expanding
OL,9,     Feastwards, but his invasion of
OL,10,     FPoland tips the world into a
OL,11,     Fviolent and bloody war.
OL,12,G1500 Adolf Hitler's War
OL,13,     FA Superhuman Act of Inhumanity:
OL,14,     FBetrayed, Stalin fights the German
OL,15,     Farmy in the Soviet states. The
OL,16,     FGerman occupation policies lead to
OL,17,     Fthe first extermination policies
OL,18,     Fof 'undesirables'.
